[role="dialog"], [role="dialog"] *, [role="alertdialog"], [role="alertdialog"] *, [data-radix-popper-content-wrapper], [data-radix-popper-content-wrapper] * { color: #0f172a; }

Also apply the same expansion to the input override (line 53-58) and to every exception rule (lines 60-69: .text-white/.text-red-600/.text-emerald-600/.text-amber-700/.text-slate-500/.text-slate-600/.text-blue-600). Alternative: use a single combined selector list [role="dialog"], [role="alertdialog"] { ... } at the top and reuse everywhere. After the fix, re-verify by reopening the venue delete confirmation and asserting computed color of the H2 title and 'Vazgeç' button are rgb(15,23,42).
